Package: cohortprofiler
Title: Validate a REDCap Export and Render a Descriptive Analysis Report
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("VITAL-HMB study team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Takes a REDCap label export, validates it against a declarative
    YAML spec, builds a tidy analysis frame, and renders a descriptive and
    univariate analysis report to DOCX and PDF. Study knowledge lives entirely
    in the spec, so the same code serves any cohort.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    flextable,
    ggplot2,
    gtsummary,
    naniar,
    readr,
    rmarkdown,
    stats,
    utils,
    yaml,
    zip
Suggests:
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: pandoc, libreoffice-writer (for DOCX to PDF conversion)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
